    "en": "Hibiki: “Tudo bem, Kaede. I’ve fully isolated the room’s band. Zero external noise. Sound, light—everything tuned for Millia’s healing.”",
    "ja": "Hibiki「Tudo bem, Kaede。手術室の帯域、完全に隔離したよ。外部ノイズはゼロ。音も光も、全部Milliaの治癒のために調整済み」"
